# Atlaris Tech Stack

Use this as concise project context. Do not treat hosted service versions as known unless a local source exposes them; when only an SDK is present, cite the SDK package version.

## Runtime and App Framework

- Node.js: `>=24 <25` from `package.json` `engines`.
- Package manager: `pnpm@11.9.0`; repo constraint is `pnpm >=11 <12`.
- Next.js: `16.3.2`; default `dev` uses Webpack; `dev:turbopack` and `build` use Turbopack (`dev:workflow` uses Webpack).
- React: `19.2.8`; React DOM: `19.2.8`.
- React Compiler: enabled in `next.config.ts`; `babel-plugin-react-compiler` package `1.0.0`.
- TypeScript: `6.0.3`; typecheck runs via `tsc --noEmit` (`pnpm check:type`).

## Data and Backend

- Supabase local CLI package: `2.115.0`.
- Local Supabase/Postgres config: database `major_version = 17` in `supabase/config.toml`.
- Drizzle ORM: `0.45.2`; Drizzle Kit: `0.31.10`.
- Postgres driver: `postgres` package `3.4.9`.

## Styling, Testing, and Tooling

- Tailwind CSS: `4.3.3`; PostCSS integration `@tailwindcss/postcss` `4.3.3`.
- Vitest: `4.1.11`; Vite: `7.3.6`.
- Playwright: `@playwright/test` `1.62.1`.
- TypeScript runner: `tsx` `4.23.12`.
- Lint/format tooling: `oxlint` `1.79.0`, `oxlint-tsgolint` `0.25.0`, `oxfmt` `0.64.0`.

## Critical Third-Party Services

- Clerk auth and billing: `@clerk/nextjs` `7.8.0`; Clerk Billing uses Stripe as payment gateway without a direct `stripe` SDK dependency; Supabase local auth config also enables Clerk as a third-party provider.
- Email delivery: SDK package `resend` `6.18.0`.
- Sentry observability: SDK package `@sentry/nextjs` `10.70.0`; `next.config.ts` wraps the app with Sentry config.
- OpenRouter AI: SDK package `@openrouter/sdk` `0.13.67`.
- Workflow durable jobs: SDK package `workflow` `4.8.0`; Next config uses `workflow/next`.
- Vercel Flags: `flags` `4.3.0`; Vercel adapter `@flags-sdk/vercel` `1.4.6`.
- Vercel telemetry packages: `@vercel/analytics` `2.0.1`, `@vercel/speed-insights` `2.0.0`.

## Version Sources

- Package specs and constraints: `package.json`.
- Exact installed package versions: local `pnpm`/`node_modules` resolution because the lockfile is not available through the normal workspace reader.
- Service/config confirmation: `next.config.ts`, `tsconfig.json`, `vitest.config.ts`, `playwright.config.ts`, `drizzle.config.ts`, `postcss.config.mjs`, `supabase/config.toml`, and `src/lib/config/env/*`.
